        {
          "code": "M1",
          "desc": "Solve for $a^3$"
        },
        {
          "code": "A1",
          "desc": "Determine $a = 2$"
        }
      ],
      "solution": "The point $(3, -5.5)$ lies on the graph $\\implies f(3) = -5.5 \\implies -5.5 = 2.5 - a^3 \\implies a^3 = 8 \\implies a = 2$.",
      "ai_explanation": {
        "concept_rule": "A given point satisfies the equation of the function.",
        "step_by_step": [
          "Set $-5.5 = 2.5 - a^3$.",
          "Rearrange to solve for $a^3$: $a^3 = 2.5 + 5.5 = 8$.",
          "Take the cube root: $a = \\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$."
        ],
        "common_pitfalls": "Sign error when rearranging $-5.5 = 2.5 - a^3$."
